## Aesthetic Mapping: Inside vs Outside aes()

:::: {.columns}
::: {.column width="60%"}

::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code  code-line-numbers="|3-4|7-8"}
# MAPPED to data (inside aes)
ggplot(bp_data, 
       aes(x = Age, y = SysBP_0m,
           color = TreatmentGroup)) +
  geom_point(size = 3)

# FIXED value (outside aes)
ggplot(bp_data, 
       aes(x = Age, y = SysBP_0m)) +
  geom_point(color = "blue", size = 3)
```
:::


::: {.fragment}
**Key rule**: Inside `aes()` = mapped to data, Outside = fixed value
:::
:::

::: {.column width="40%"}

::: {.cell}
::: {.cell-output-display}
![](module_2_aesthetics_faceting_themes_files/figure-revealjs/unnamed-chunk-18-1.png){width=576}
:::
:::

:::
