# Section 2: Faceting Strategies {background-color="#2C5F8D"}

## facet_wrap(): Single Variable Faceting

:::: {.columns}
::: {.column width="60%"}

::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code  code-line-numbers="|4"}
